OL,3,GNEWSAThe all-female team building
OL,4,Acareers in construction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn all-female construction management
OL,7,Fteam is calling for more women to work
OL,8,Fin the industry, with one manager
OL,9,Fsaying "it's still nowhere near
OL,10,Fenough".
OL,12,FSenior site manager Blair Harvey, who
OL,13,Fis part of a team at Kingfisher Park in
OL,14,FFelbridge, on the Surrey-West Sussex
OL,15,Fborder, said although it was better for
OL,16,Fwomen now than when she started, more
OL,17,Fwork was needed.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
