OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe all-female team building
OL,4,Acareers in construction
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen make up about 15% of the UK
OL,7,Fconstruction workforce, with an
OL,8,Festimated 305,850 women in the sector
OL,9,Fcompared to 1.75 million men, Office
OL,10,Ffor National Statistics data shows.
OL,12,FHarvey said: "Even though we are
OL,13,Fgetting a lot more women come through,
OL,14,Fit's still nowhere near enough. We need
OL,15,Fto make this industry more
OL,16,Fdiversified."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
